Daily routine (@daily-routine: 0, is #chapter, #contains @sleep, #contains @eat-an-apple, #contains @exercise) {
Sleep, eat an apple, and exercise are three independent daily habits. Each Frequency makes its Record a Need (-1). Set the quantity to zero when you complete it. An incomplete habit stays at -1 when its next occurrence arrives.

The Frequencies use example times in UTC, starting on 2 January 2030. Choose the times, timezone, and first occurrences before using the example for your own routine. The simulation uses these same Records, Frequencies, and Rules.
}

Sleep (@sleep: 0, #part-of @daily-routine) {
The example makes Sleep due at 22:00 UTC. Record completion after sleeping.
}

Eat an apple (@eat-an-apple: 0, #part-of @daily-routine) {
The example makes Eat an apple due at 08:00 UTC. Record completion after eating an apple.
}

Exercise (@exercise: 0, #part-of @daily-routine) {
The example makes Exercise due at 17:00 UTC. Record completion after the activity.
}

Frequency daily-sleep {
    title "Daily sleep"
    quantity 1
    every 1 day
    timezone "UTC"
    next_at 2030-01-02T22:00:00Z
}

Frequency daily-apple {
    title "Daily apple"
    quantity 1
    every 1 day
    timezone "UTC"
    next_at 2030-01-02T08:00:00Z
}

Frequency daily-exercise {
    title "Daily exercise"
    quantity 1
    every 1 day
    timezone "UTC"
    next_at 2030-01-02T17:00:00Z
}

Karma daily-routine {
    Rules {
        Rule reset-sleep-need {
            quantity 1
            frequency @daily-sleep
            record @sleep
            condition """freq(@daily-sleep)"""
            gate !=0
            carry const:-1
            consequences """[{"kind":"set-quantity"}]"""
        }

        Rule reset-apple-need {
            quantity 1
            frequency @daily-apple
            record @eat-an-apple
            condition """freq(@daily-apple)"""
            gate !=0
            carry const:-1
            consequences """[{"kind":"set-quantity"}]"""
        }

        Rule reset-exercise-need {
            quantity 1
            frequency @daily-exercise
            record @exercise
            condition """freq(@daily-exercise)"""
            gate !=0
            carry const:-1
            consequences """[{"kind":"set-quantity"}]"""
        }
    }
}
